id=wg-user
name=wg-user — Userspace WireGuard Proxy
version=0.3.1
versionCode=7
author=wg-user contributors
description=Auto-starts a userspace WireGuard client and exposes it as a SOCKS5/HTTP proxy on 127.0.0.1. No TUN device. Multi-arch, multi-root (KSU/Magisk/APatch). Optional wstunnel obfuscation for mobile. WebUI included.
